  "compatibilityDecisions": {
    "data-grid": "Retain shared owner/TanStack boundary and beta9 feature/state adapters; current registry creates components/reui duplicates and exposes newer v9 features. No blanket upgrade.",
    "filters": "Retain Core serialized flat filter/public hook adapters. Current upstream requires query/onQueryChange, compiler trees and cascader dependencies; copying would be an API/state migration.",
    "c-file-upload-1": "Retain existing crop/async backend ImageUpload behavior; upstream file hook would change state ownership. Improve existing disabled/removal behavior.",
    "generic-controls": "Existing official shadcn Base UI wrappers remain canonical. Reuse compatible example composition through current wrappers; omit unused demo modules and engine dependencies.",
    "premium-candidates": "Initial compose_page metadata shortlisted app-shell-18/app-shell-20,navbar-6,stats-2,solution-analytics-7. After owner-confirmed public distribution permission, actual settings-7/settings-11 source was selectively integrated; actual app-shell-18 source was retained for product/provider/theme compatibility, not blocked by licensing. Other metadata-only candidates did not justify adding demo metrics/providers or replacing cohesive Core compositions."
  },
